.Dd August 31, 2026
.Dt HAWKEYE.CONF 5
.Os CloudBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm hawkeye.conf
.Nd JSON configuration for
.Xr hawkeye 8
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Configuration is strict JSON
.Pq RFC 8259 .
No comments, no trailing commas, no JSONC.
Secrets belong in environment variables, never in the file.
Files that might hold secrets are mode
.Li 0600 .
.Pp
Per-user path
.Pq used first if the file exists :
.Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/hawkeye/config.json
.Pq default
.Pa ~/.config/hawkeye/config.json
.Pp
System path:
.Pa /usr/local/etc/cloudbsd/hawkeye/config.json
.Pp
The live
.Pa config.json
is optional.
If it is absent,
.Nm hawkeye
and
.Nm hawkeye Fl -check-config
use compiled defaults
.Pq the same as
.Nm hawkeye Cm doctor
.Ns .
Install ships
.Pa config.json.sample
.Pq mode 0644; no secrets
and does not require the operator to copy it before
.Fl -check-config
succeeds.
A present file is still validated; invalid JSON fails.
.Pp
Generate a sample with
.Nm hawkeye Cm init .
Validate with
.Nm hawkeye Fl -check-config
before
.Dv SIGHUP .
.Sh KEYS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Va log_level
.Li DEBUG ,
.Li INFO ,
.Li WARN ,
or
.Li ERROR .
.It Va listen.mcp_http
MCP Streamable HTTP bind address.
Must be loopback.
Default
.Li 127.0.0.1:8741 .
.It Va listen.tls_cert , Va listen.tls_key
Optional PEM paths if Hawkeye itself terminates TLS.
When empty, the loopback listener is plain HTTP and nginx
.Pq or another reverse proxy
provides TLS.
.It Va listen.mcp_token_env
Name of the environment variable that holds the MCP HTTP bearer token.
Default
.Ev HAWKEYE_MCP_TOKEN .
The token itself is never stored in JSON.
.It Va knowledge.paths
Ordered search paths for
.Pa knowledge.sqlite .
Default
.Pa /boot/hawkeye
then
.Pa /usr/local/share/hawkeye .
XDG data dirs are also searched.
.It Va llm.local.backend
Local backend.
Default
.Li llama.cpp .
.It Va llm.local.model_path
Path to a local model.
Empty means LLM is optional.
.It Va llm.local.prefer_gpu
Try GPU then CPU.
.It Va llm.local.require_gpu
If true, GPU jobs fail when no GPU is present.
Default false.
Missing GPU must not block jobs that do not need GPU.
.It Va llm.remote.provider
Optional remote provider name
.Pq Grok, FreeGrok, Claude .
.It Va llm.remote.endpoint
Optional HTTPS endpoint.
.It Va llm.remote.api_key_env
Name of the environment variable that holds the API key.
Default
.Ev HAWKEYE_LLM_API_KEY .
The key itself is never stored in JSON.
.It Va resources.ram_min_free_bytes
Refuse RAM-consuming jobs when free RAM is below this.
.It Va resources.cpu_max_pct
Refuse CPU-consuming jobs when host CPU is above this.
.It Va resources.disk_min_free_bytes
Refuse disk-consuming jobs when free disk is below this.
.It Va resources.gpu_vram_min_free_bytes
Refuse GPU jobs when free VRAM is below this.
Null means unused.
Doctor still reports GPU presence.
.It Va pidfile
Pidfile path.
Must not be empty or negative.
Created mode
.Li 0644
.Pq the PID is not a secret so doctor can read it without root .
.It Va audit_log
JSON-lines apply audit log.
Mode 0600 when created.
Default
.Pa /var/log/hawkeye/audit.log .
If the directory cannot be created
.Pq read-only root or missing
.Pa /var
during
.Nm hawkeye Cm apply Fl -yes
.Ns ,
apply still lands; the skip is noted on stderr
.Pq dry-run already uses a no-op auditor
.Ns .
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Ev HAWKEYE_CONFIG
Override config path.
.It Ev HAWKEYE_LLM_API_KEY
Remote LLM API key
.Pq never placed in the JSON file .
.It Ev HAWKEYE_MCP_TOKEN
Bearer token for Streamable HTTP MCP.
Required for
.Nm hawkeye Cm mcp Fl -http .
Not required for stdio.
Never place the token in JSON, man pages, or the README.
.It Ev HAWKEYE_MCP_TOKEN_FILE
Optional path to a mode
.Li 0600
file containing the token
.Pq trailing newline stripped .
Used when
.Ev HAWKEYE_MCP_TOKEN
is unset.
.It Ev HAWKEYE_JSON
When set to
.Li 1 ,
.Li true ,
or
.Li yes ,
.Nm hawkeye Cm consult
and
.Nm hawkeye Cm plan
emit JSON on stdout the same as
.Fl -json .
Unset means the operator session.
.It Ev HAWKEYE_KNOWLEDGE_PATH
Override knowledge search path for tests and rescue overlays.
When set, compiled defaults and XDG paths are not searched.
.It Ev HAWKEYE_DATA_ARTIFACT
Source
.Pa knowledge.sqlite
for
.Nm hawkeye Cm update .
.It Ev VISUAL , Ev EDITOR
Editor for
.Nm hawkeye Cm consult
.Cm e
on a TTY.
.Ev VISUAL
is tried first, then
.Ev EDITOR ,
then
.Ic vi .
.It Ev XDG_CONFIG_HOME , Ev XDG_DATA_HOME
Per-user config and data.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr hawkeye 8
